WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.864 --> 00:00:06.780
MARK MIRCHANDANI: Analysts
and data scientists

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.360
are often dealing with data
that's complex and not ready

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.930
for immediate analysis.

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:13.140
In fact, they spend
almost 80% of their time

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.060
cleaning and preparing data.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.730
Accelerating this process helps
businesses be more responsive

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.740
with data-driven decisions.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.050
That's where Google
Cloud Dataprep comes in.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:23.710
Dataprep is an
intelligent data service

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.010
for visually
exploring, cleaning,

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:28.710
and preparing both structured
and unstructured data

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:29.827
for analysis.

00:00:29.827 --> 00:00:31.410
It's a browser-based
service and works

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.030
at any scale with
no infrastructure

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.610
to deploy or manage.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.530
In this lab, you'll use Dataprep
to manipulate a data set.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:41.520
You will import data sets,
correct mismatched data,

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.610
transform data, and join data.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:45.990
If this is all
new to you, you'll

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:47.948
know what all this means
by the end of the lab.

00:00:47.948 --> 00:00:50.400
And it'll only take
you 45 minutes.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.650
With Cloud Dataprep, you
can easily prepare big data

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.050
for things like training
machine learning models,

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:56.760
studying visual
analytics, or for

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.440
powerful interactive
queries that

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:00.360
unlock insights from your data.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.650
This lab is part of the
baseline data ML and AI quests

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:04.769
on Qwiklabs.

00:01:04.769 --> 00:01:06.360
Completing all the
labs in this quest

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.954
earns you this badge to
recognize your new skills.

00:01:08.954 --> 00:01:11.370
You can show off your badge
on your resume or social media

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:12.600
channels.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:16.850
Next on our quest, Google
Cloud Datalab Qwik Start.

